7. Conclusion

Agile methodology is a modern software development approach that helps teams deliver high-quality software quickly and efficiently. It improves communication, teamwork, flexibility, and customer satisfaction.

In simple words: Agile means developing software step by step, getting regular feedback, and making improvements continuously.
